title: "SCUBAS: Submarine Cables Upset by Auroral Streams"
abstract: "A physics-based workflow for estimating the voltage induced on submarine cables during geomagnetic disturbances, using transmission-line modelling of layered Ocean/Earth conductivity structures."
type: software
